CITY OF CHEYENNE
CONTRACT MODIFICATION

Contract Modification:
#2
Project:

Professional Services – City Financial Investment Services
Project Number:

City Contract #6305
Contractor:

RBC Global Asset Management (U.S.) Inc.
Date Prepared:

06/04/2018

The above referenced contract is hereby modified in the manner set forth in the following and such
amendment and modification are agreed to by the undersigned, being parties to the contract.  All other
provisions and aspects of current Contract #6305 remain unchanged in full force.

I.
 Description of modification:

Section 2.  Term.  This Contract is effective when all parties have executed it and all approvals
have been granted.  The term of this Contract shall be through June 30, 2017 2018 2019, with the fees
set forth in Appendix B being effective as of March 1, 2015.  By mutual agreement, this Contract may be
extended for two (2) additional one (1) year periods.

II.
Summary:

The current professional services contract expires June 30, 2018 and continuation of the existing
provisions and services provided by the contractor for one additional year is desired to enable time to
issue a Request For Proposals (RFP) for future services, resulting in a recommendation being submitted
for approval by the governing body involving a new contract.

III.
Approvals                                                                                           Date:___________________

City of Cheyenne:                                                                                                  (S E A L)

